# adbd runs as root in the su domain (adb root: --root_seclabel=u:r:su:s0). AOSP makes su permissive on
# userdebug/eng; the GSI's system/sepolicy dropped that (it compiles the userdebug policy for user builds
# too), which leaves a root adbd unable to bind its auth socket: adbd crash-loops and adb goes offline.
userdebug_or_eng(`
  permissive su;
')
